cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Cosmic Web Atlas"
abstract: >-
  An interactive 3D model of the large-scale structure of the universe, from the
  Local Group out to the cosmic microwave background, in a single HTML file
  (Three.js). It places the 43,482 galaxies of the 2MASS Redshift Survey in
  supergalactic coordinates from their redshifts (downloaded at run time from
  CDS VizieR), a 600,043-object sample of DESI Data Release 1 galaxies and
  quasars out to z = 3.5, adds several hundred clusters, superclusters, walls, voids,
  quasars and record-distance galaxies at their literature positions, and fills
  unmapped regions with a Voronoi foam model. It includes guided tours, search,
  an atlas index, a distance-measuring tool, a look-back-time shell and
  English/Turkish interfaces. Cosmology: H0 = 70 km/s/Mpc, Omega_m = 0.3.
